	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/campaign_ai/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Marines and Covenant fight as units, led through\ndrills. From the next map; off: the stock AI."/>
		<string text="Trained models choose the drills and each\nsoldier's way of fighting. From the next map."/>
		<string text="Soldiers outside a unit's drill choose their own\nway of fighting."/>
		<string text="How freely units choose among the drills they\nrate well. Best: always the best one."/>
		<string text="Commanded soldiers hold their nerve: fewer\npanics, berserk charges and lone pursuits."/>
		<string text="Soldiers choose targets by threat: what is\nhurting them, Elites first."/>
		<string text="How far from its leader, in world units, a\nsoldier is still in its unit."/>
		<string text="How widely the AI's shots spread, and how fast\nthe Marines fire."/>
	</strings>
